      "slug": "ripe-plantain",
      "term": "Ripe plantain",
      "definition": "Plantain with a mostly black or very yellow skin. The flesh is soft and sweet, unlike green plantain which is starchy and bland. Ripe plantain caramelises well when fried."
    },
